@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #AAAAAA
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #DDDDDD
}

title 招商&券 数据格式流转时序图
autonumber

actor "运营" as Operator
actor "商家(poi)" as Merchant
participant "招商平台" as Recruitment order 10
participant "券平台补贴系统" as Subsidy order 20


Operator -> Recruitment++: 创建招商活动
    Recruitment -> Subsidy++: 同步招商活动：\n 招商id、状态、补贴规则
    return 父补贴方案id
return

Operator -> Recruitment++: 上传品池
return

Recruitment -> Subsidy++: 同步增量品池(UPC)信息\n+ 父补贴方案id
return

Merchant -> Recruitment++: poi 报名
return

Recruitment -> Subsidy++: 同步商家报名信息(poi)\n+ 父补贴方案id
return

@enduml
